{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ab79ac24c233a9af","x":-1700,"y":386,"width":578,"height":468,"type":"group","label":"运算性质"},
		{"id":"67e1727e877e623f","type":"text","text":"# 配方视角","x":-219,"y":-303,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"800c925c52a9206f","type":"text","text":"左乘，行配方","x":-364,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b5201e53afe267ca","type":"text","text":"右乘，列配方","x":-48,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0e347460bd64a36e","type":"text","text":"几何视角","x":1060,"y":-303,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6aaa177f6211407f","type":"text","text":"左乘，改变基座标","x":1060,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"024f33a4e9bd6257","type":"text","text":"# 点积视角","x":553,"y":-303,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"edb823badbd1e85a","type":"text","text":"信息的匹配/相关性","x":553,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"917432ed37c5526c","type":"text","text":"初等行变换/列变换：\n左乘/右乘稍微变化的单位矩阵\n（初等矩阵）","x":-238,"y":70,"width":334,"height":94,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"6d03db1524c996d0","type":"text","text":"# 可逆矩阵 ：\n满秩矩阵，假设为 A。\nPQ 为单位矩阵的变换\nPA 或 AQ一定能将 A 化为 E。\n\n记 P 或 Q 为 A 的逆\n\n","x":-509,"y":240,"width":270,"height":227},
		{"id":"f441a66971d153ed","type":"text","text":"当如此定义一个矩阵时\n![](2.知识库/20.North_star_ZJU/201.数学/线性代数/02矩阵/assets/Pasted%20image%2020260328111600.png)\n我们发现 A 乘此矩阵为|A|E，\n于是我们构造出了求 A^-1 的方法\n只是与 A* 差了一个倍数而已。倍数为 A 的行列式分之一","x":-374,"y":660,"width":544,"height":340},
		{"id":"d3c1dacb43bc3d74","type":"text","text":"将 A 矩阵与 E 矩阵横着拼接，\n行变换可将 A 化为 E，\n此时的操作也将 E 化为了 $A^{-1}$\n\n","x":-960,"y":724,"width":280,"height":167},
		{"id":"0ab94d1901e1df91","type":"text","text":"# 等价矩阵 ：\n秩相等。\n假设 A、B 等价\n- 若都为满秩，一定有 PA=B 或 AQ=B\n- 若不满秩，一定有 PAQ=B\n","x":-1043,"y":229,"width":363,"height":250},
		{"id":"7155d05602d0e54a","type":"text","text":"# 秩\n用初等行变换或初等列变换，\n可以化简矩阵，找到矩阵的“秩”","x":75,"y":285,"width":305,"height":182},
		{"id":"3bb0357da9ca6970","type":"text","text":"理解转置矩阵\n-  $A^TA$ 衡量了 $A$ 中**各个列（特征）之间的相关性/相似度**。\n-  $AA^T$ 衡量了 $A$ 中**各个行（样本或数据点）之间的相关性/相似度**\n\n","x":499,"y":-3,"width":358,"height":240},
		{"id":"a2476813c6440a33","type":"text","text":"$(AB)^{-1}=B^{-1}A^{-1}$\n$(AB)^{T}=B^{T}A^{T}$\n$(AB)^{*}=B^{*}A^{*}$\n$|AB|=|A||B|=|B||A|$","x":-1397,"y":661,"width":250,"height":173},
		{"id":"1d39a178669b163e","type":"text","text":"$(A^{-1})^{- 1}=A$\n$(A^{T})^{T}=A$\n$||A|| = |A|$\n$(A^{*})^{*}=|A|^{n-2}A$ \n\n","x":-1397,"y":406,"width":255,"height":184},
		{"id":"4ba55c2b24c6abc9","type":"text","text":"$(kA)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{k}A^{-1}$ \n$(kA)^{T}={k}A^{T}$ \n$|kA| = k^n|A|$\n$(kA)^{*}= k^{n-1}A^*$ \n","x":-1649,"y":423,"width":227,"height":183},
		{"id":"1e0b30534c809500","type":"text","text":"${(A^{-1})}^T={(A^{T})}^{-1}$\n${(A^{-1})}^*={(A^{*})}^{-1}$\n${(A^{*})}^T={(A^{T})}^{*}$\n${|A|}^T=|A^{T}|$\n${|A|}^{-1}=|A^{-1}|$\n${|A|}^*=|A|^{n-1}$\n\n\n\n\n","x":-1680,"y":626,"width":258,"height":182},
		{"id":"a24b20cfce29512e","x":374,"y":572,"width":304,"height":236,"type":"text","text":"$r (A)<=min{m, n}$\n$r (A) r (B)<=min(r(A), r(B))$\n$r (A+B)<=r (A)+r (B)$\n\n若，AB=O，则 $r (A)+r (B)<=n$\n"},
		{"id":"8b7eb3a059c19996","x":-2280,"y":1080,"width":665,"height":376,"type":"text","text":"\n$\\begin{vmatrix} B & O \\\\ O & A \\end{vmatrix} = |B||A|$。      \n$\\begin{vmatrix} B & O \\\\ O & A \\end{vmatrix} = (-1)^{mn}|B||A|$\n\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix} A & B \\\\ C & D \\end{bmatrix} \\xrightarrow{\\text{分块行变换}} \\begin{bmatrix} A & B \\\\ \\mathbf{O} & \\mathbf{D - CA^{-1}B} \\end{bmatrix}$\n\n$\\begin{vmatrix} A & B \\\\ C & D \\end{vmatrix} = |A| \\cdot |D - CA^{-1}B|$\n\n\n$\\begin{vmatrix} A & B \\\\ C & D \\end{vmatrix} = |D| \\cdot |A - BD^{-1}C|$\n\n\n\n"},
		{"id":"1a1c90249a3ea258","x":-1547,"y":891,"width":250,"height":69,"type":"text","text":"# 分块矩阵"},
		{"id":"ab15d8f6ff8e7f8b","x":-1505,"y":1140,"width":467,"height":460,"type":"text","text":"![](../../../../../assets/image/笔记-1774410208131.jpeg)\n\n![](../../../../../assets/image/笔记-1774497379515.jpeg)\n![](../../../../../assets/image/笔记-1774497493122.jpeg)\n\n\n\n\n"},
		{"id":"05788b612fc2a8d9","x":276,"y":-500,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# 矩阵的理解"}
	],
